{"id":"00056","root":"uni00056_1","name":{"ja":"眞田　焔","en":"Sanada Homura"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"眞田　焔","en":"Sanada Homura"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-11-02","limited":false,"characterId":49,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。長らく実戦に身を置き、その実力は折り紙つき。あまたの魔族との戦闘をこなしてきたため、魔族との戦闘にかけてはかなりの腕。非常に血の気が多く、闘う事しか考えていない。対魔忍とは名ばかりの戦闘狂。そのため、長期の任務に就くことが多かったが、ひとたび里に戻ると、教師だろうが生徒だろうがお構い無しに特訓と称してぼこっているため、一部からは恐れられている。実際は実力を認めている相手にしかしないため、それを知っている者は止める事はしない。","en":"Sanada Homura is a Taimanin. She has spent a long time on the front lines, and her skill is unquestionable. Having fought countless demons, she is highly proficient in battles against them. She's extremely hot-blooded and thinks of nothing but fighting. Though she bears the title of Taimanin, she's essentially a combat fanatic. Because of this, she often takes on long-term missions, but whenever she returns to the village she—whether she's a teacher or a student—unleashes relentless training sessions on anyone, earning fear from some quarters. In reality, she only pushes those who have earned her respect, and those who know this do not try to stop her."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00056_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[770,1540],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[116,232],"def":[91,182],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","40001"]},{"id":"uni00056_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1140,2280],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[182,364],"def":[132,264],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","40001","40002"]},{"id":"uni00056_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1510,3021],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[248,494],"def":[173,345],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","40001","40002"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural damage"}]},"40001":{"slot":"skill1","id":40001,"name":{"ja":"火遁槍"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKを小アップする"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKを小アップする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKを小アップする"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKを小アップする"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のATKを小アップする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All allies: ATK +20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_up"}]},"40002":{"slot":"skill2","id":40002,"name":{"ja":"忍法・火遁槍炎陣"},"hits":5,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 560% Natural damage"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"火遁-炎陣"},"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ユニットのATKを小アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Natural allies: ATK +10%","icon":"atk_up"}]},"abilities":[],"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"「あぁ？　そう、私が眞田焔だ。喧嘩なら、いくらでも相手してやる……って、違うのか。つまんねぇな」","en":"Huh? That's right, I'm Sanada Homura. Want a fight? I could take you on forever… or not? How boring."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"暇だな……。おいお前、私と勝負しろよ。ってこら、逃げんじゃねぇ！","en":"I'm bored… Hey, you, challenge me. Hey, don't run away!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"こうなにもねぇと、身体が鈍っちまいそうだ。なんかいい任務はねぇかな？","en":"If I don't have anything to do, my body feels like it's getting dull. Got any good missions?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"そうだ。たまには槍の手入れでもしとくか。他にやることもねぇし","en":"Right. Maybe I'll clean my spear for a change. Nothing else to do anyway."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"あん？　なんだよ、さっきからチラチラ見て。やるってのか？","en":"Huh? What's with you staring at me? You wanna fight or what?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"はぁ、ちょっと散歩でもしてくるか。どっかにいい喧嘩相手はいるかなーっと","en":"Ah, I'll go for a walk. Wonder if there's a good opponent out there."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"あー、頭痛ぇ……。あれから、酔いが醒めやしねぇ。ほんと、あんなのは二度とごめんだぜ","en":"Ugh, my head hurts… That hangover still hasn't cleared. Seriously, never again."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"わかってる、反省してるって。……でも、もし次があったら、今度はもう少し優しいやつにしてくれよな","en":"I get it, I'm reflecting on it… but if something comes up again, make it a bit gentler next time, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00056_1/uni00056_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo